stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Bound
    Bound --> Inspect: Restart reconnect or next idle input
    Inspect --> Bound: Present / verified reconnect
    Inspect --> ProveMissing: Complete exact endpoint snapshot lacks pane
    Inspect --> Reject: Unknown during idle input
    ProveMissing --> Retired: Same nonce and observed row CAS
    ProveMissing --> Reject: Proof, row read or CAS fails
    Retired --> FreshLaunch: Rejudge this input
    FreshLaunch --> Delivered: New execution accepts input
    FreshLaunch --> Reject: New launch fails before input
    Reject --> Discarded: One channel reason, settle exact claim
    Delivered --> [*]
    Discarded --> [*]
    Inspect --> Held: Frozen policy, Missing interpreted as Held
    Held --> Held: Dead pane probe = Unknown / Keep
    WorkingTurn --> TemporaryHold: Source not ready
    TemporaryHold --> Inspect: Existing turn boundary wake
